      peak VRAM fits, AND the fp16 image has no artifacts/black output. (Couldn't run full
      generation in the dev session — kernels + policy verified, but not a full denoise.)
- [ ] If fp16 shows artifacts: revisit the dtype policy (e.g. keep text encoder bf16, or make
