- core/CLAUDE.md                             Memory + Compute-dtype design contract (updated)

## GOTCHAS (also in memory/target-hardware-t4.md)

- NEVER combine torchao int8 with CPU offload — deadlocks.
- T4 has no bf16 acceleration; fp16 is the fast path. fp16 VAE decode can overflow -> keep it upcast.
- torch here is bleeding edge (2.13.0+cu130); torchao 0.17 dropped the "int8_weight_only" STRING
  API — must pass the config OBJECT (Int8WeightOnlyConfig()).
